{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"screen\": \"也许对方也喜欢他在身边，想到这儿他有点高兴\",\n      \"source\": \"不安还没答案，他却觉得眼前的美好似乎比自己的愿望更大，也许对方也喜欢他在身边。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿写的是对眼前美好的体会和对对方心意的猜测，并未明确写他因此高兴，屏幕增加了情绪判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"带着近乎恳求的劲儿还想要更多，却始终没法完全满足（第15秒出现） / 私语像放大成天地共振，人被卷进更大的世界，连自己都退到后面（第18秒出现）\",\n      \"source\": \"第62–71小节那支异常温柔、晴朗的歌，在这里被放到了最大尺度……内心的私语仿佛放大成天地的共振。……这股声浪却不是一路畅通地冲到顶。原本温柔的歌带上近乎恳求的力量，旋律一次次向上伸展，仿佛还想要更多，却始终不能完全满足。到第96–100小节附近……那口气一直悬到102–103小节交界，才得到一次重大的释放。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"屏幕先出现对应第96–103小节的近乎恳求、无法满足，再出现对应第62–71小节的天地共振，颠倒了定稿明确的音乐推进顺序。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06b5df6c-7729-47c1-995f-76a2f4af6514", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T051404518034Z", "elapsed_seconds": 399.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:20:43.934740+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1cfca9904c4fc11837c2e71c46b961309e1e96092c9fe4ceed82540988ff74da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initialize